{"custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.৫০ কাটা যাবে।", "question_text": {"Math-Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) 5<sup>2x + 1</sup> = 125<sup>x - 1</sup> হলে, x এর মান কত?", "option1": "3", "option2": "- 5", "option3": "10", "option4": "4", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: 5<sup>2x + 1</sup> = 125<sup>x - 1</sup> হলে, x এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p>সমাধান:<br>5<sup>2x + 1</sup> = 125<sup>x - 1<br></sup>⇒ 5<sup>2x + 1</sup> = (5<sup>3</sup>)<sup>x - 1<br></sup>⇒ 5<sup>2x + 1</sup> = 5<sup>3x - 3<br></sup>⇒ 2x + 1 = 3x - 3<br>⇒ 2x - 3x = - 3 - 1<br>⇒ - x = - 4<br>∴ x = 4</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) log<sub>3</sub>(1/81) = কত?", "option1": "- 4", "option2": "3", "option3": "- 5", "option4": "9", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: log<sub>3</sub>(1/81) = কত?</p>\r\n<p>সমাধান:<br>log<sub>3</sub>(1/81)<br>= log<sub>3</sub>(1/3<sup>4</sup>)<br>= log<sub>3</sub>(3<sup>-4</sup>)<br>= - 4 × log<sub>3</sub>3 <span>   [log<sub>a</sub>(a<sup>n</sup>) = n × log<sub>a</sub>a]<br></span>= - 4 × 1  [<span>log<sub>a</sub>a = 1]<br></span>= - 4</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) (200x)<sup>0</sup> + 200x<sup>0</sup> + (200x)<sup>0</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "200", "option2": "1", "option3": "202", "option4": "3", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: (200x)<sup>0</sup> + 200x<sup>0</sup> + (200x)<sup>0</sup> এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p>সমাধান:<br>(200x)<sup>0</sup> + 200x<sup>0</sup> + (200x)<sup>0</sup>   [আমরা জানি, a<sup>0</sup> = 1 ; যেখানে a ≠ 0]<br>= 1 + (200 × 1) + 1<br>= 1 + 200 + 1<br>= 202</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) log<sub>x</sub>(0.0001) = - 4 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "- 5", "option2": "10", "option3": "- 15", "option4": "8", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: log<sub>x</sub>(0.0001) = - 4 হলে x এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p>সমাধান:<br>log<sub>x</sub>(0.0001) = - 4<br>⇒ x<sup>- 4</sup> = 0.0001    [log<sub>a</sub>b = c হলে, a<sup>c</sup> = b]<br>⇒ x<sup>- 4</sup> = 1/10000<br>⇒ x<sup>- 4</sup> = 1/10<sup>4<br></sup>⇒ x<sup>- 4</sup> = 10<sup>- 4<br></sup>⇒ x = 10</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) (16)<sup>0.375</sup> × (16)<sup>0.125</sup> = ?", "option1": "64", "option2": "4", "option3": "32", "option4": "8", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: (16)<sup>0.375</sup> × (16)<sup>0.125</sup> = ?</p>\r\n<p>সমাধান: (16)<sup>0.375</sup> × (16)<sup>0.125</sup>  [আমরা জানি, a<sup>m</sup> × a<sup>n</sup> = a<sup>m + n</sup>]<br>= (16)<sup>(0.375 + 0.125)<br></sup>= (16)<sup>0.50<br></sup>= (16)<sup>1/2<br></sup>= (4<sup>2</sup>)<sup>1/2</sup>  [আমরা জানি, (a<sup>m</sup>)<sup>n</sup> = a<sup>m × n</sup>]<br>= 4<sup>(2 × 1/2)<br></sup>= 4<sup>1<br></sup>= 4</p>\r\n<p>∴ নির্ণেয় মান হলো 4।</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) log<sub>a</sub>(b<sup>3</sup>) = 3x এবং log<sub>b</sub>(a<sup>3</sup>) = 3y হলে, xy = কত?", "option1": "1", "option2": "xy", "option3": "9", "option4": "12xy", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: log<sub>a</sub>(b<sup>3</sup>) = 3x এবং log<sub>b</sub>(a<sup>3</sup>) = 3y হলে, xy = কত?</p>\r\n<p>সমাধান:<br>দেওয়া আছে, log<sub>a</sub>(b<sup>3</sup>) = 3x<br>⇒ 3 log<sub>a</sub>b = 3x<br>⇒ log<sub>a</sub>b = x</p>\r\n<p>আবার, log<sub>b</sub>(a<sup>3</sup>) = 3y<br>⇒ 3 log<sub>b</sub>a = 3y<br>⇒ log<sub>b</sub>a = y</p>\r\n<p>আমরা জানি, log<sub>a</sub>b × log<sub>b</sub>a = 1<br>সুতরাং, xy = log<sub>a</sub>b × log<sub>b</sub>a<br>∴ xy = 1</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip0_Yka9w9V.png\" width=\"288\" height=\"118\">", "option1": "x<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "x<sup>5</sup>", "option3": "x", "option4": "1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_uy11rOp.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"98\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip2_C2uFPbf.png\" width=\"261\" height=\"678\"></p>"}, {"id": "8", "questio