uestion": "১৭) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20251115_6.png\" width=\"588\" height=\"95\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "3", "option2": "1", "option3": "5", "option4": "- 4", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20251115_6_jtRO0pW.png\" width=\"539\" height=\"87\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20251115_7.png\" width=\"653\" height=\"513\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20251115_22.png\" width=\"390\" height=\"76\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "10/3", "option2": "4", "option3": "12/7", "option4": "16/5", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20251115_22_NRA3zph.png\" width=\"390\" height=\"76\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20251115_23.png\" width=\"539\" height=\"709\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "125", "option2": "5<sup>y + 1</sup>", "option3": "5<sup>2y + 3</sup>", "option4": "5<sup>y</sup>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p>সমাধান:<br>5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup> + 5<sup>y</sup><br>= 5<sup>y</sup>(1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1)<br>= 5<sup>y </sup>. 5<sup>1</sup><br>= 5<sup>y + 1</sup></p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.